<!--
  Reference DTD for the ICH eCTD v3.2 backbone (index.xml), used by PPR's
  Layer 1 (XML Schema) validation.

  It mirrors the ICH eCTD v3.2.2 element hierarchy (CTD modules 1-5), the
  leaf / node-extension model and the lifecycle "operation" attribute.
  Before production use, replace this file with the official
  ich-ectd-3-2.dtd from the ICH eCTD v3.2.2 specification package, or
  point the ECTD_DTD_PATH setting at it.

  Generated by PPR. Note the eCTD XLink namespace is intentionally
  "http://www.w3c.org/1999/xlink" (w3c.org), exactly as in the ICH specification.
-->

<!ELEMENT ectd:ectd (m1-administrative-information-and-prescribing-information?, m2-common-technical-document-summaries?, m3-quality?, m4-nonclinical-study-reports?, m5-clinical-study-reports?)>
